.TH ACE_GPERF 1 "November 2026"
.UC 4
.SH NAME
ace_gperf \- generate C++17 perfect hash lookup code from a key set
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ace_gperf
[
.I options
] [
.I keyfile
]
.SH DESCRIPTION

\fIace_gperf\fP reads a set of ``keys'' from \fIkeyfile\fP (or, by
default, from standard input) and attempts to find a perfect hashing
function that recognizes a member of the key set with one lookup. If
such a function is found, the program writes C++17 source code for the
hash function and lookup table to standard output. ACE gperf uses the
ACE version number in its generated output.

Please refer to the \fIace_gperf.texi\fP file for more information.
This file is distributed with the ACE gperf release.
